# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Plan files must never be committed - they can contain resolved secrets.
*.tfplan
tfplan
tfplan.*

# Never commit real variable values outside environments/*.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
secrets.tfvars

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
